function createWithdrawal_(context,input){var network=cleanString_(input.network,20).toUpperCase();var address=validateNetworkAddress_(network,input.address);var amount=Number(input.amount);var minimum=Number(getSetting_('MINIMUM_WITHDRAWAL',10));assert_(amount>=minimum,'AMOUNT_TOO_LOW','El retiro no alcanza el mínimo configurado.');var wallet=findRecord_('Wallets','userId',context.user.id);if(!wallet||Number(wallet.data.availableBalance)<amount)throw apiError_('INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE','El balance disponible no cubre este retiro.',409);var fee=Number(getSetting_('WITHDRAWAL_FEE_'+network,0));var now=nowIso_();return insertRecord_('Withdrawals',{id:newId_('wdr'),userId:context.user.id,network:network,address:address,amount:amount,fee:fee,netAmount:roundMoney_(amount-fee),currency:'USDT',transactionHash:'',status:'REQUESTED',createdAt:now,updatedAt:now,schemaVersion:1});}

